cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or refer to the study, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DermaReach: Classification of Selected Skin Diseases Using Artificial Intelligence for Dark Skin Tones"
abstract: >-
  Companion code for a master's research project that develops a convolutional
  neural network (VGG16 transfer learning) for multi-class classification of
  acne, eczema, and keloids on dark skin tones. A primary clinical dataset of
  400 images was collected, augmented to about 2,650 views, and used to train
  and evaluate the model as a baseline for African dermatology AI.
